units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p f
read_data ../ag_w_qsgs.data.gz
pair_style soft 2.8
pair_coeff 1 1 0.0
pair_coeff 1 2 50.0
pair_coeff 2 2 0.0
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
region fixed_region block INF INF INF INF 0.0 20.0 units box
group fixed region fixed_region
fix hold fixed setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0
fix tether all spring/self 10.0
thermo 25
thermo_style custom step atoms pe etotal fmax fnorm
thermo_modify lost error
min_style cg
min_modify dmax 0.05 line quadratic
minimize 1.0e-8 5.0e-2 500 10000
unfix tether
write_data soft_clear.data
